WEBVTT

00:05:54.558 --> 00:06:00.898
It can afford to buy whatever is available
and for sale in its own currency.

00:06:01.857 --> 00:06:05.820
Now that might mean
spending on roads and bridges,

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:09.615
a military arsenal
or hospitals and schools.

00:06:10.908 --> 00:06:16.539
Finding the votes to pass
a spending bill can be hard,

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:18.874
but finding the money

00:06:18.916 --> 00:06:20.334
is never a problem.

00:06:21.836 --> 00:06:23.129
They just create it.

00:06:24.338 --> 00:06:25.756
So here's how it works.

00:06:26.882 --> 00:06:31.512
Whenever Congress and the president
agree to spend more,